  s0: Old version serving
  s1: Failure held for reconciliation
  s2: Intent rejected, no effect
  s3: Exact intent admitted
  s4: Additive schema ready
  s5: Reconcile same durable intent
  s6: Target cohort warming
  s7: Canary route, versions overlap
