  [*] --> s0
  s0 --> s1: controller stops with durable intent retained
  s0 --> s2: reject a stale or incompatible intent
  s0 --> s3: accept one exact signed target
  s3 --> s4: expand the schema while both versions remain compatible
  s4 --> s6: start target allocations within surge capacity
  s1 --> s5: restart under the same intent
  s5 --> s3: reconcile observed allocations before resuming
  s6 --> s1: target health fails, keep old cohort and hold
  s6 --> s7: target health passes
  s7 --> s8: route proof is lost, stop further effects
  s8 --> s1: fresh readback confirms the exact current route
